      "description": {
        "fun": "A plump little bird with a built-in compass: however far Pidgey flies, it can always find its way straight back to its nest. Despite its name it looks more like a house sparrow than a pigeon, and it has the shortest cry of any Pokémon, at under a fifth of a second.",
        "guide": "A small, plump Normal and Flying bird Pokémon, common in meadows and forests. It has an extremely sharp sense of direction and always finds its way back to its nest, and it would rather flee than fight. It evolves into Pidgeotto and then Pidgeot.",
