      "description": {
        "fun": "Pidgeot can fly faster than the speed of sound, and a few flaps of its powerful wings whip up a windstorm. Its glossy plumage and long red-and-yellow crest make it a favourite of skilled Trainers, and its sharp eyes can spot Magikarp from high above the water. Its name blends 'pigeon' and 'jet'.",
        "guide": "The final stage of Pidgey's line, a large bird Pokémon with a long crest and powerful wings that can stir up windstorms and fly faster than sound. Its beautiful plumage makes it popular with Trainers. Pidgeot can Mega Evolve into Mega Pidgeot.",
